    {
      "id": "intro",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": -540,
      "y": -200,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "davidparsons.me — Quiet Index\n\nThe direction that shipped. Newsreader serif for prose, IBM Plex Mono for every date and label, one ink on warm paper, no accent colour. Links are a hairline that firms up on hover.\n\nBuilt and live: Next.js 16, all five notes at their original URLs, all 24 talks, a working contact form.\n\nThe two directions that were not chosen are on the second page."
    },
    {
      "id": "dir-b",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": -540,
      "y": 40,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "B — Standing Rail (not chosen)\n\nFixed identity rail on the left carrying name, bio, nav and links on every page; content flowing on the right. Space Grotesk set tight, one deep teal for links and focus only."
    },
    {
      "id": "dir-c",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": -540,
      "y": 1780,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "C — Workbench (not chosen)\n\nInk-dark, mono-forward, two muted accents, with a ⌘K palette that jumps to any page, post or talk. The second artboard in this row shows the palette open."
    }
  ],
